---
---
<footer id="contact" class="py-16 md:py-[120px] px-6 md:px-20 pb-8 md:pb-16 bg-dark">
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 lg:gap-20 self-stretch mb-12 md:mb-24">
    <!-- Contact Text -->
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-bold text-base">09</span>
          <span class="w-6 h-[1px] bg-accent"></span>
          <span class="text-accent font-mono font-semibold text-sm uppercase">Contato</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-light font-semibold text-3xl md:text-[44px] leading-[1.15em] font-[Sora]">Vamos construir algo extraordinário juntos?</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-muted font-[Sora] text-base leading-[1.6em] max-w-[720px]">
        Seja para estruturar o MVP da sua nova startup, redesenhar sistemas de backend complexos ou otimizar a sua gestão de produtos ágeis, estou sempre aberto a novos desafios intelectuais.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Box -->
    <div class="w-full lg:w-[480px] flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col p-6 md:p-10 gap-5 md:gap-6 bg-dark-card border border-dark-border rounded-2xl">
      <span class="text-accent font-mono font-semibold text-xs uppercase">Canais Diretos</span>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-[18px] h-[18px] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <img src="/images/mail.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-light font-[Sora] text-sm md:text-base">rinel@benjamim.dev</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-[18px] h-[18px] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <img src="/images/linkedin.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-light font-[Sora] text-sm md:text-base">linkedin.com/in/rinelbenjamim</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-[18px] h-[18px] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <img src="/images/github.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-light font-[Sora] text-sm md:text-base">github.com/rinelbenjamim</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Divider -->
  <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-dark-border mb-6 md:mb-8"></div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <span class="text-light font-bold text-xl font-[Sora]">R.</span>
      <span class="text-muted font-[Sora] text-[12px] md:text-[13px]">© 2025 Rinel Benjamim. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-accent font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[13px]">Engenharia de Software & Produto</span>
  </div>
</footer>
